[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 8762.389, "timestamp": "02:26:02", "text": "呃，就像你知道的，就像在YouTube上发帖一样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8766.469, "timestamp": "02:26:06", "text": "呃，很多YouTube上的东西。那么，发生了什么事？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8769.51, "timestamp": "02:26:09", "text": "就像我以前制作视频一样"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8773.03, "timestamp": "02:26:13", "text": "YouTube。所以，我知道我也会这样做。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8776.23, "timestamp": "02:26:16", "text": "当我在YouTube上看到那些精彩瞬间时，我也很喜欢。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8779.349, "timestamp": "02:26:19", "text": "上一次。所以这就是我想说的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8781.67, "timestamp": "02:26:21", "text": "就像你知道的那样，这就是你了解的方式。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8783.59, "timestamp": "02:26:23", "text": "你这样做就像那里有东西一样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8785.03, "timestamp": "02:26:25", "text": "这是个好时刻，这是个坏时刻"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8786.15, "timestamp": "02:26:26", "text": "片刻。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8787.67, "timestamp": "02:26:27", "text": "这太尴尬了。并非如此"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8789.75, "timestamp": "02:26:29", "text": "令人尴尬。我想你应该知道那是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8793.03, "timestamp": "02:26:33", "text": "那。我想你会原谅我的。我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8795.19, "timestamp": "02:26:35", "text": "再见。我的天哪。好的。任何"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8797.03, "timestamp": "02:26:37", "text": "你现在正在做的，我很确定你能做到。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8801.03, "timestamp": "02:26:41", "text": "感觉就像我不知道十倍一样。你可以这样做"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8804.95, "timestamp": "02:26:44", "text": "无论我做什么，你都可以做到。嗯"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8807.99, "timestamp": "02:26:47", "text": "我很好，没关系。我想你当时"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8810.63, "timestamp": "02:26:50", "text": "有点低，但如果我这么做的话，工作还算可以。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8814.07, "timestamp": "02:26:54", "text": "讲话。好的。它有点忽高忽低，但"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8816.63, "timestamp": "02:26:56", "text": "我想应该没问题吧。我不认为我不"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8819.83, "timestamp": "02:26:59", "text": "我觉得我的音频是不是太吵了"}]